  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">InformAction - Building people power for Accountable Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance accountable and responsive governance through activities aimed at i) ensuring citizens participate and input into the local government annual planning and budgeting process; ii) citizens hold local elected leaders accountable to preselection promises; and iii) citizens demand their human rights at the local level.</narrative>
  </description>
